// Personaggi di Foscari: 0xb7e6 Eleanor, 0x2470 Maruto, 0x16b6d Keitha, 0xb1f1 Luminaire, 0x7c3 Genevieve, 0x98d5 Je-Ne-Viv, 0x796b Sammy
